  "notes": "Often used in military or historical contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {降伏|こうふく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to surrender)\n- ⟦{無条件|むじょうけん}→無条件：13475_mujouken⟧{降伏|こうふく} (unconditional surrender)\n- {降伏|こうふく}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{受|う}け{入|い}れる→受け入れる：05755_ukeireru⟧ (to accept surrender)\n- {降伏|こうふく}⟦{文書|ぶんしょ}→文書：12947_bunsho⟧ (instrument of surrender)\n\nWATCH OUT:\n- ⟦{幸福|こうふく}→幸福：02750_koufuku⟧ - happiness, well-being\n\nThese two words are both read こうふく but have opposite emotional connotations - {降伏|こうふく} (surrender/defeat) vs ⟦{幸福|こうふく}→幸福：02750_koufuku⟧ (happiness).\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{投降|とうこう}→投降：19468_toukou⟧ (surrender - of individuals)\n- ⟦{敗北|はいぼく}→敗北：12872_haiboku⟧ (defeat)",
